    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Team Paul Reddy is delighted to bring to the market No. 5 Estuary Court, a spacious four-bedroom semi-detached family home extending to approximately 120 sq.m., ideally positioned within this established and popular residential development off Seatown Road, Swords. The property enjoys a pleasant outlook overlooking a large green area to the front and benefits from a private driveway, convenient side entrance, oil-fired central heating, solar panels providing an energy-efficient source for domestic hot water, B3 energy rating, new front and rear doors, and a master bedroom with en-suite. The living room also features a traditional open fireplace, creating a warm and welcoming focal point.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall leading to a spacious living room with open fireplace, open plan kitchen/dining room and guest W.C. at ground floor level. Upstairs, there are four well-proportioned bedrooms, including the master bedroom with en-suite, together with a family bathroom. The property offers bright, generous and well-balanced accommodation throughout, ideal for modern family living.\r\n\r\nTo the front, the property is approached via a private driveway providing off-street parking and enjoys an attractive outlook over the adjoining green area. A convenient side entrance provides access to the rear garden. The rear garden offers excellent outdoor space for family activities and entertaining and is further enhanced by a large chalet-style timber garden shed with power, providing excellent additional storage or potential for use as a home office, hobby room or workshop, subject to the purchaser's requirements.\r\n\r\nThe property is further enhanced by its B3 energy rating, oil-fired central heating and solar panels which assist in heating the domestic hot water, helping to improve the home's energy efficiency. The recently upgraded front and rear doors are an additional benefit.\r\n\r\nEstuary Court is ideally located close to a wide range of amenities in Swords, including schools, shops, sporting facilities, restaurants and recreational amenities. Swords Main Street, Pavilions Shopping Centre and Airside Retail Park are all within easy reach, while Dublin Airport and the M1 and M50 motorway network are readily accessible.\r\n\r\nThis spacious four-bedroom home offers generous accommodation, a pleasant green outlook, excellent outdoor space and a convenient location, making it an ideal choice for families and owner-occupiers alike.\r\n\r\n\r\nNote: Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs are provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR: \r\n\r\nHall\t                              5.43 x 1.88m     \r\nTiled flooring\r\n\r\nLiving Room                     5.43 x 3.98m      \r\nCarpeted flooring, featuring open fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitchen Area                    5.87 x 2.75m      \r\nOpen-plan kitchen/dining. Fully fitted units, tiled splashback, tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nDining Area                      3.86 x 3.09m      \r\nTiled flooring, door to back garden\r\n\r\nGuest WC                         1.65 x 0.86m      \r\nWC & WHB\r\n\r\nBack Garden      \r\nLow-maintenance back garden, large chalet-style timber garden shed with power\r\n\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR: \r\nLanding              2.17 x 3.29m \t \r\nCarpeted flooring \r\n\r\nBedroom 1        4.33 x 3.35m   \r\nCarpeted flooring, built-in wardrobes\r\n\r\nEn-suite             1.32 x 2.19m   \r\nShower, WHB, WC, fully tiled.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2        3.44 x 3.09m \t \r\nCarpeted flooring, built-in wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 3        2.77 x 2.45m   \r\nCarpeted flooring, built-in wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 4        2.51 x 3.45m   \r\nCarpeted flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom          2.20 x 1.65m   \r\nBath, WHB, WC, fully tiled."
      },
